@startuml 自习设计顺序图
' 赵冠钧 · 第二阶段设计 · 顺序图
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

actor 玩家 as P
participant "StudyPage" as Page
participant "StudyController" as Ctrl
participant "LocationProviderPort" as LP
participant "StudyApi\n(Fake/Http)" as API

== 正常：开始至触发 ==
P -> Page : 开始自习(regionId)
Page -> Ctrl : startStudy(SIMULATED|GPS)
Ctrl -> API : createTask(requestId,...)
API --> Ctrl : TaskSnapshot WAITING
Ctrl -> LP : start()
loop 采样
  LP --> Ctrl : LocationSample
  Ctrl -> API : uploadSample(taskId, sample)
  API --> Ctrl : TaskSnapshot(+accepted)
  Ctrl --> Page : 刷新 TaskViewState
end
API --> Ctrl : status=TRIGGERED, spawnId
Ctrl --> Page : 显示前往答题
note right of Ctrl
  spawnId 仅来自响应
  禁止本地伪造
end note

== 异常：权限拒绝 ==
Ctrl -> LP : start()
LP --> Ctrl : LocationError PERMISSION_DENIED
Ctrl --> Page : 说明+去设置/重试
note over Ctrl, API
  不 uploadSample
  不发奖
end note

== 异常：断网 ==
LP --> Ctrl : LocationSample
Ctrl -> API : uploadSample
API --> Ctrl : 网络失败
Ctrl --> Page : 连接问题
Ctrl -> API : getCurrent()
API --> Ctrl : 真实快照或仍失败
note over Ctrl
  本地不设 TRIGGERED
end note

== 结束 ==
P -> Page : 结束
Page -> Ctrl : endStudy()
Ctrl -> API : endTask(requestId)
API --> Ctrl : ENDED
Ctrl -> LP : stop()
@enduml
